 	AWS WAF integrates with CloudWatch and AWS CloudTrail for monitoring and auditing purposes. You can:
Create CloudWatch Alarms: Set up alarms based on specific metrics such as request counts or blocked requests.
View Detailed Logs: Enable AWS WAF logging to capture detailed logs of requests that are allowed or blocked by your Web ACL. You can store these logs in S3 or stream them to CloudWatch or Kinesis.
