It is an instance of the Image.
Image is a logical entity.
A container is a real world entity.
The image is created only once.
Containers are created any number of times using image.
Images are immutable.
Containers change only if the old image is deleted and new is used to build the container.
Images do not require computing resources to work.
Containers require computing resources to run as they run as Docker Virtual Machine.
