⇒ subnet: it is a vpc component and it is used to divide ip range. here we create 2 subnets one is public and another one is private 
→ in route table we attach internet gateway it is public subnet 
→  in route table we attach NAT gateway it is  private subnet
→ public subnet direct connect internet using igw
→ private subnet want to  connect internet we use NAT gateway or NAT instance
