✅ SECTION 1: AWS INTERVIEW Q&A (10)
What is EC2 and when would you use it?
EC2 is a virtual server in the cloud. Use it when you need full control over an OS, such as for hosting a web app.
How to troubleshoot EC2 SSH not working?
