Correct key pair and username
Instance state and public IP
Logs: /var/log/secure or auth.log
Difference between IAM User and Role?
User = long-term access, humans. Role = temporary access, machines (e.g., EC2).
Steps to host a static website on S3?
Create bucket
Enable static website hosting
Upload content
Make public using bucket policy
What is an Elastic Load Balancer (ELB)?
ELB distribute traffic across multiple targets (EC2s). Useful for high availability.
How does Auto Scaling work?
Automatically increases/decreases EC2s based on metrics (CPU, traffic).
What is CloudWatch?
Monitoring tool for logs, metrics, alarms (e.g., CPU > 80%, send alert).
How to copy files from local to S3?
aws s3 cp myfile.txt s3://my-bucket/
Explain VPC with public & private subnets.
Public = Internet-facing (via IGW), Private = internal. Use NAT for outbound traffic.
Use case of CloudTrail?
Track API calls & user activity. Useful for auditing and security.
